sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser/CLI
    participant S as Server

    Note over U,S:REGISTER ACCOUNT
    U->>B:Name + account password
    B->>B:Generate BIP39 seed phrase (24 words)
    B->>B:Derive X25519 scalar from seed (HKDF, clamped)
    B->>B:pubkey = scalar x G, kid = SHA-256(pubkey)
    B->>B:Derive X-Wing decapsulation key from account scalar (domain-separated HKDF)
    B->>B:Lock scalar with password KEK (Argon2id + ChaCha20-Poly1305)
    Note right of B:Blob stored on device (localStorage / account.enc)
    B->>S:POST /api/account [kid, pubkey, name]
    S->>S:Verify kid = SHA-256(pubkey); 409 if taken
    S->>B:Account profile (kid, name)
    B->>S:Authenticated POST /api/account/{kid}/xwing [X-Wing public key]
    Note right of B:Server never sees the seed phrase or private key

    Note over U,S:CREATE PASTE (password mode)
    U->>B:Text/File + Password (or empty for auto-generated)
    B->>B:Generate salt(16B) + nonce(12B) + random content key CEK(32B)
    B->>B:master = Argon2id(password, salt, 32B)
    B->>B:kek = HKDF(master, "mitsuzo-encryption-key")
    B->>B:val_key = HKDF(master, "mitsuzo-validation-key")
    B->>B:hash = HMAC-SHA256(val_key, salt)
    B->>B:Wrap CEK: ChaCha20-Poly1305(kek, wrap_nonce) → wrapped_key(48B)
    B->>B:Encrypt chunks with ChaCha20-Poly1305(CEK)
    Note right of B:Derived nonce = base_nonce XOR chunk_index
    B->>S:POST /api/paste [header: salt, hash, key envelope, meta]
    S->>B:Return paste ID
    B->>S:PUT /api/paste/{id}/chunk/{i} [16MB upload chunks, resumable]
    B->>S:POST /api/paste/{id}/complete
    Note right of S:Stores: files/{id} + files/{id}.nonce
    Sled DB: pass, salt, key, meta, burn

    Note over U,S:CREATE PASTE (recipient mode)
    U->>B:Text/File + recipient account
    B->>B:Generate CEK + encapsulate to recipient X-Wing public key
    B->>B:Derive wrap key = HKDF-SHA256(X-Wing shared secret, info)
    B->>B:Seal CEK with ChaCha20-Poly1305(wrap key)
    B->>S:POST /api/paste [recipient envelope, no salt/hash]
    S->>S:Validate recipient_pub matches account (if registered)
    S->>B:Return paste ID
    B->>S:PUT chunks + complete (same protocol as password mode)
    Note right of B:Sender keeps the shared secret in browser session memory to reopen the paste

    Note over U,S:VIEW PASTE (password mode)
    U->>B:Paste ID + Password (from URL #hash)
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/salt
    S->>B:mode=Password + Argon2 salt (KDF bootstrap — everything else requires auth)
    B->>B:master = Argon2id(password, salt) → kek + val_key = HKDF(master)
    B->>B:hash = HMAC-SHA256(val_key, salt)
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/data + X-Password-Hash [Range supported]
    alt Hash matches (constant-time compare)
        S->>B:Metadata frame (nonce, chunks, type, size, wrapped CEK, tries) + ciphertext
        B->>B:Unwrap CEK with kek (legacy pastes: derived key = CEK)
        B->>B:Decrypt chunks with CEK and derived nonce
        B->>U:Display plaintext / Download file
    else Hash mismatch
        S->>S:try_count-- + fail stats++
        S->>S:if try_count==0, delete paste
        S->>B:401 + remaining try_count/ttl body
    end

    Note over U,S:VIEW PASTE (recipient mode)
    U->>B:Paste ID + account
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/salt
    S->>B:mode=Recipient + paste recipient info (kid, name)
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/challenge
    S->>B:Challenge sealed to recipient pubkey (single-use, 60s TTL)
    B->>B:Solve with ECDH(account scalar, server ephemeral_pub) → response nonce
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/data + X-Account-Proof:{kid}:{nonce}
    alt Proof verifies (single-use, constant-time)
        S->>B:Metadata frame (recipient envelope) + ciphertext
        alt New X-Wing paste
            B->>B:Decapsulate X-Wing ciphertext with account seed; derive wrap key; open CEK
        else Legacy X25519 paste
            B->>B:Open CEK with legacy X25519 ECDH envelope
        end
        B->>B:Decrypt chunks with CEK
        B->>U:Display plaintext / Download file
    else Proof invalid / stale
        S->>B:401 + fresh challenge
    end
    Note right of B:Sender reopens with the retained session shared secret; legacy pastes use the old ECDH envelope

    Note over U,S:ACCOUNT INBOX
    U->>B:Open account page
    B->>S:GET /api/account/{kid}/challenge → solve with account scalar
    B->>S:GET /api/account/{kid}/inbox + X-Account-Proof
    S->>B:Recipient-mode pastes addressed to this kid
    B->>U:List (id, filename, type) → open any paste

    Note over U,S:CHANGE PASSWORD
    U->>B:New password
    B->>S:GET /api/paste/{id}/data (range) + X-Password-Hash [old hash]
    S->>B:Metadata frame (password-wrapped CEK)
    B->>B:Unwrap CEK with old kek
    B->>B:New salt → master' = Argon2id(new password, salt')
    B->>B:kek' + val_key' = HKDF(master') → re-wrap CEK with kek'
    B->>B:hash' = HMAC-SHA256(val_key', salt')
    B->>S:POST /api/paste/{id}/password + X-Password-Hash [old hash]
    alt Old hash matches
        Note right of S:Updates only pass, salt, key — ciphertext untouched
        S->>B:200 OK
    else Hash mismatch
        S->>S:try_count--
        S->>B:401 Unauthorized
    end
